+emit('''_DoomReciprocalStep:
+; Exact low 16 bits of (0xffffffff / d) >> 7, for positive d.
+; floor(floor(N/d)/128) = floor((2^25-1)/d).
+; FixedDiv(512,d) gives floor(2^25/d); subtract one iff d divides 2^25.
